sing internet protocols rather than traditional terrestrial, satellite, or cable formats."}]]}],["$","details","Is IPTV Legal in the UK?",{"className":"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800","children":"Is IPTV Legal in the UK?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600","children":"IPTV technology itself is completely legal, and many official broadcasters use it to deliver their services. Legality depends on whether the provider has the proper rights and licenses to distribute the content it offers, so always choose a service that operates through authorised content distribution."}]]}],["$","details","Is IPTV Safe to Use?",{"className":"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800","children":"Is IPTV Safe to Use?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600","children":"Yes. IPTV UK uses stable, encrypted streaming servers, and your login details are only ever sent to you directly. As with any online service, keep your account details private and only share them with our official support team."}]]}],["$","details","Is IPTV Blocked by My Internet Provider?",{"className":"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800","children":"Is IPTV Blocked by My Internet Provider?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600","children":"No. IPTV services generally work over any standard broadband connection, including with providers such as Virgin Media and Sky. Occasional slowdowns are usually down to general network congestion rather than blocking."}]]}],["$","details","What Is an IPTV Box?",{"className":"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4","children":[["$","summary",null,{"classNam